WEBVTT

01:30.580 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 30]

01:43.479 --> 01:44.310
Zhen.

01:45.150 --> 01:48.400
Are you still thinking about Qi Jiu?

01:49.280 --> 01:51.150
Getting upset over a man

01:51.200 --> 01:52.200
is not worth it.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.150
No.

01:54.840 --> 01:56.170
I was thinking about how

01:56.430 --> 01:58.120
Zen Master Fahui said today

01:59.000 --> 02:02.280
that the Noble Consort
is devoted to Buddhism.

02:03.150 --> 02:04.310
A person devoted to Buddhism

02:04.310 --> 02:06.070
would copy sutras often.

02:06.280 --> 02:08.710
Why hasn't even Zen Master Fahui seen

02:08.750 --> 02:10.280
the sutras copied by the Noble Consort?

02:10.280 --> 02:11.120
Zhen!

02:11.840 --> 02:12.590
Zhen!

02:12.960 --> 02:13.630
Zhengshen.

02:13.630 --> 02:14.560
Bad news.

02:15.000 --> 02:15.630
What's wrong?

02:15.630 --> 02:16.280
Zhen.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.160
Speak slowly.

02:17.590 --> 02:20.120
Qi Chun brought a huge group of men today

02:20.120 --> 02:22.400
to search for all the
most valuable ink manufacturing materials

02:22.400 --> 02:23.680
in all of Nanjing.

02:23.910 --> 02:25.980
Styrax resin, borneol,

02:26.030 --> 02:27.840
century-old pearls,
thousand-year-old fleeceflower root—

02:27.840 --> 02:29.120
he bought them all.

02:29.680 --> 02:32.000
Zhen, with just these ingredients,

02:32.110 --> 02:33.640
how can we compete with him?

02:34.870 --> 02:36.150
What are you afraid of?

02:36.360 --> 02:37.630
We'll go buy some too.

02:38.310 --> 02:39.590
Missy,

02:39.630 --> 02:41.360
you're oversimplifying this.

02:41.520 --> 02:42.560
I heard

02:42.680 --> 02:44.960
he bought them directly in the name
of the Directorate of Imperial Household.

02:44.960 --> 02:46.910
Others don't stand a chance.

02:48.630 --> 02:52.079
Zhen, will we lose to the Tian family?

02:53.610 --> 02:54.980
No. Don't worry.

02:59.590 --> 03:00.360
Xianglan.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.180
Is there any occasion

03:03.400 --> 03:05.660
where I can see the Noble Consort myself?

03:08.190 --> 03:10.520
If it's too difficult, forget it.

03:12.750 --> 03:13.630
There is!

03:13.870 --> 03:16.470
Tomorrow, Commander Wu from Nanjing

03:16.470 --> 03:19.200
is hosting a winter solstice banquet
at his home.

03:19.590 --> 03:22.560
The Princess and the Noble Consort
will definitely attend.

03:22.560 --> 03:24.710
My father worked with Commander Wu.

03:24.960 --> 03:27.310
He knows I'm in Nanjing.

03:27.520 --> 03:30.520
Normally, he would
send me an invitation as well.

03:31.120 --> 03:32.000
Great.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.240
Then we still have a chance.

03:34.630 --> 03:36.030
This birthday inkstick—

03:36.280 --> 03:38.750
since it's a birthday gift
from a daughter to her mother—

03:38.750 --> 03:39.960
if we want to make

03:40.000 --> 03:41.960
the ink that best suits
the Noble Consort's liking,

03:41.960 --> 03:43.000
we need to know

03:43.000 --> 03:45.710
how the Princess and the Noble Consort
get along,

03:45.710 --> 03:48.430
and what the Princess cares about most
when it comes to the Noble Consort.

03:48.430 --> 03:49.150
Only then

03:49.150 --> 03:50.310
can we hit the mark.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.000
I got it.

03:54.910 --> 03:56.000
The winter solstice banquet

03:56.000 --> 03:58.310
is the best time to understand
the mother-daughter bond

03:58.310 --> 04:00.640
the Princess and the Noble Consort share.

04:01.240 --> 04:03.430
Don't worry, I will definitely attend.

04:03.430 --> 04:05.120
Then you can dress up as...

04:07.680 --> 04:08.960
You'll have to put up with it,

04:08.960 --> 04:10.560
but you can dress up as my maid

04:10.870 --> 04:11.750
and go with me.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.150
Thank you, Xianglan.

04:14.150 --> 04:15.120
Of course!

04:21.750 --> 04:24.080
Let me... Let me
take another sip of water.

04:32.720 --> 04:36.730
[Nanjing Garrison Commander
Wu Ru's Mansion—Wu's Mansion]

04:37.830 --> 04:39.680
Zhen, let me tell you,

04:39.750 --> 04:41.430
this Noble Consort Du

04:41.430 --> 04:43.680
actually comes from a humble background.

04:43.680 --> 04:46.190
So after the Princess was born,

04:46.190 --> 04:49.560
she was raised
by the Empress Dowager and the Empress.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.560
It wasn't until recently

04:52.560 --> 04:55.159
that she returned
to the Noble Consort's side.

04:55.800 --> 04:58.560
But the rules in the palace are strict.

04:58.720 --> 04:59.920
So in a month,

04:59.920 --> 05:02.120
they might not even see each other once.

05:03.680 --> 05:05.510
Although born into the royal family,

05:05.510 --> 05:06.800
she is also a pitiful person.

05:06.800 --> 05:09.200
It's better to be born
in an ordinary family

05:09.290 --> 05:11.750
one would be able to enjoy
the happiness of family life that way.

05:11.750 --> 05:14.880
The Noble Consort doesn't come
from a noble background?

05:17.240 --> 05:19.430
Other concubines
are daughters of officials.

05:19.430 --> 05:20.240
Only she

05:20.270 --> 05:21.510
was an embroiderer.

05:27.380 --> 05:28.220
Xianglan.

05:29.740 --> 05:31.070
Xianglan, you're here.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.150
Mrs. Wu,

05:32.190 --> 05:33.560
am I late?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.240
No.

05:36.600 --> 05:37.270
Xianglan.

05:38.159 --> 05:39.480
Take your seat quickly.

05:39.480 --> 05:40.120
Yes.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.270
You are all here so early.

05:43.270 --> 05:44.070
Yes.

05:44.190 --> 05:45.240
Yes.

05:47.120 --> 05:49.190
The Noble Consort has arrived!

05:49.630 --> 05:51.830
Princess Shouyang has arrived!

06:08.240 --> 06:09.300
After you, Mother.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.240
After you, Princess.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.540
Thank you, Mother.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.070
Please.

06:22.560 --> 06:24.830
We pay our respects to the Noble Consort

06:22.880 --> 06:26.640
[Noble Consort Du]

06:24.830 --> 06:27.000
and Your Highness.

06:29.800 --> 06:31.310
Please rise.

06:31.950 --> 06:33.680
Thank you, Noble Consort,

06:33.750 --> 06:35.480
and Your Highness.

06:40.159 --> 06:41.159
Take your seats.

06:50.390 --> 06:51.480
Today,

06:51.630 --> 06:54.480
the Princess and I were invited by Mrs. Wu

06:53.640 --> 06:56.120
[Mrs. Wu]

06:54.510 --> 06:56.390
to attend the winter solstice banquet.

06:56.390 --> 07:00.120
I have also specially invited
Zen Master Fahui

07:00.510 --> 07:03.160
to pray for our safety and blessings.

07:04.000 --> 07:06.430
Thank you, Noble Consort.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.560
Mother.

07:09.560 --> 07:11.190
I offer a toast to you.

07:13.360 --> 07:16.360
I wish you peace, health,
and endless happiness.

07:20.720 --> 07:22.180
Let's all drink together.

07:23.000 --> 07:25.310
Thank you, Noble Consort.

07:26.160 --> 07:27.950
I am very fortunate

07:28.270 --> 07:31.480
to be able to invite
the Noble Consort and the Princess

07:31.600 --> 07:33.390
to my home for a banquet.

07:34.000 --> 07:35.630
My Wu's mansion

07:35.630 --> 07:38.000
is truly graced by your presence today.

07:38.800 --> 07:40.190
Indeed.

07:39.420 --> 07:42.530
[Mrs. Lin of Qiantang]

07:40.240 --> 07:42.920
In order to welcome
the Noble Consort and the Princess,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.510
Commander and Mrs. Wu

07:44.510 --> 07:46.720
specially built this banquet room.

07:46.970 --> 07:48.710
We are able to accompany you here

07:48.710 --> 07:50.830
and see the elegance
of the Noble Consort and the Princess

07:50.830 --> 07:54.040
all thanks to Commander Wu and Mrs. Wu.

07:54.260 --> 07:57.010
On my trip to Nanjing this time to pray,

07:57.350 --> 08:00.040
Commander and Mrs. Wu have helped a lot.

08:00.070 --> 08:03.040
I should also thank you.

08:08.190 --> 08:11.560
To be able to serve
the Noble Consort and the Princess

08:11.560 --> 08:13.600
is my honor.

08:13.920 --> 08:16.600
Because the Noble Consort
had not arrived before,

08:16.600 --> 08:18.720
the scroll in the central hall

08:19.120 --> 08:20.800
was left blank.

08:21.120 --> 08:24.630
Today, the Noble Consort
has condescended to visit,

08:25.000 --> 08:26.630
so I boldly ask

08:26.950 --> 08:30.600
the Noble Consort
to grant us a calligraphy.

08:32.720 --> 08:35.960
The Wu family will definitely
look at it every day

08:36.030 --> 08:39.909
and always appreciate the kindness
of the Noble Consort.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.600
Noble Consort,

08:49.600 --> 08:52.200
please write a few words for Mrs. Wu.

08:59.670 --> 09:00.390
Zhen.

09:00.870 --> 09:02.870
Later, you should also take a careful look

09:02.870 --> 09:04.270
at the Noble Consort's calligraphy.

09:04.270 --> 09:06.000
Since they have their motives,

09:06.000 --> 09:07.390
we can't lose either.

09:13.960 --> 09:16.690
Her Grace feels quite tired today.

09:16.720 --> 09:20.270
It is not too late
to grant the scroll another day.

09:20.650 --> 09:23.540
How could I dare to let the Noble Consort

09:23.670 --> 09:25.240
spend too much energy?

09:25.840 --> 09:27.790
It's just my own hall.

09:28.150 --> 09:31.270
If you could just
casually write a few words,

09:31.510 --> 09:34.720
it would be the honor of my life.

09:43.860 --> 09:45.020
Not only do I not have

09:45.040 --> 09:47.270
the Noble Consort's
hand-copied sutras,

09:47.270 --> 09:49.780
I have never even seen them.

09:50.870 --> 09:51.790
Noble Consort Du

09:51.790 --> 09:53.670
doesn't come from a noble background.

09:53.670 --> 09:55.910
Other consorts are daughters of officials,

09:55.910 --> 09:58.240
while she was originally an embroiderer.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.000
Mrs. Wu,

10:03.360 --> 10:05.790
since the Noble Consort is unwell,

10:06.080 --> 10:07.030
let's drop it.

10:09.550 --> 10:10.670
You are?

10:15.470 --> 10:16.600
Your Highness,

10:16.670 --> 10:19.720
I am Yan Xianglan,
daughter of Yan Bingyou.

10:21.550 --> 10:23.030
Please, get up to speak.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.900
Thank you, Your Highness.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.570
Rise, all of you.

10:30.600 --> 10:32.110
I remember

10:32.270 --> 10:34.240
you had a sore on your face.

10:36.080 --> 10:36.910
Yes.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.270
But when my father was in Huizhou,

10:39.270 --> 10:41.510
he found a medicinal inkstick for me,

10:42.150 --> 10:44.600
which cured my sore of many years.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.530
Is it that miraculous?

10:47.630 --> 10:50.080
Can you let me take a look?

10:51.030 --> 10:51.840
Of course.

11:00.050 --> 11:01.250
Wait a moment, Nanny.

11:29.630 --> 11:31.720
What a miraculous inkstick.

11:32.030 --> 11:33.200
Your Highness,

11:33.510 --> 11:35.120
why not use this inkstick

11:35.150 --> 11:37.750
to write a few words for me?

11:39.910 --> 11:41.770
My mother is skilled in painting.

11:42.510 --> 11:44.150
How about she paints,

11:44.580 --> 11:46.270
and I write?

11:51.320 --> 11:52.870
What do you think?

11:54.510 --> 11:56.270
Thank you, Your Highnesses.

11:56.550 --> 11:58.480
Thank you, Your Highnesses.

12:30.720 --> 12:33.000
What? You say the Noble Consort—

12:33.200 --> 12:35.000
Keep your voice down.

12:35.510 --> 12:37.000
Doesn't know how to write?

12:38.790 --> 12:40.320
Was it you who sent a message

12:40.440 --> 12:42.390
to the Nanny during the banquet?

12:43.600 --> 12:44.790
It was me.

12:45.820 --> 12:46.940
How bold of you.

12:47.270 --> 12:48.080
Follow me.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.860
The princess wants to see you.

12:53.670 --> 12:54.910
Zh-Zhen.

12:56.630 --> 12:57.360
Xianglan.

12:57.510 --> 12:59.000
If so, I must go.

12:59.550 --> 13:00.360
Don't worry.

13:01.720 --> 13:02.960
Be careful!

13:05.750 --> 13:07.080
It's quite nice.

13:07.550 --> 13:08.320
Not bad.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.030
Everyone.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.480
Today,

13:25.240 --> 13:27.080
we won't go home until we're drunk!

13:25.420 --> 13:27.630
[Son of Commander Wu, Wu Weishi]

13:27.200 --> 13:28.750
Until we're drunk!

13:29.510 --> 13:30.600
Until we're drunk!

13:37.870 --> 13:39.270
Let's toast to Mr. Wu.

13:39.360 --> 13:40.670
Cheers.

13:41.250 --> 13:42.120
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.080
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

13:43.080 --> 13:45.540
-To Mr. Wu.
-Thank you for your hospitality!

13:46.240 --> 13:48.000
I heard the Lin family of Qiantang

13:48.000 --> 13:49.510
is going to great lengths

13:49.510 --> 13:51.150
to win the ink selection.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.480
Mr. Zhang.

13:52.910 --> 13:54.550
The Lin family merely played

13:54.550 --> 13:55.870
some petty tricks.

13:56.290 --> 13:57.910
Clerk Qi of
the Directorate of Imperial Household

13:57.910 --> 14:00.840
has served His Majesty
and the Princess for years.

14:01.270 --> 14:02.120
Besides,

14:02.670 --> 14:03.510
I came to Nanjing

14:03.510 --> 14:05.510
not just for the birthday inkstick.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.080
These tricks of the Lin family

14:07.080 --> 14:08.610
are not worth my attention.

14:08.790 --> 14:09.550
Mr. Wu,

14:09.960 --> 14:11.150
don't you agree?

14:12.870 --> 14:14.240
Rest assured, Mr. Tian.

14:14.630 --> 14:16.790
My father is Nanjing's garrison commander.

14:16.790 --> 14:18.390
There is nothing he promises

14:18.720 --> 14:20.250
that he cannot accomplish.

14:21.630 --> 14:22.630
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

14:26.270 --> 14:27.030
Xiao Qi.

14:36.720 --> 14:38.150
Princess, she's here.

14:40.320 --> 14:41.390
Your Highness.

14:42.240 --> 14:45.790
You asked Nanny to pass a message to me?

14:46.510 --> 14:48.710
I wouldn't dare deceive Your Highness.

14:48.960 --> 14:51.760
It was indeed me who had the Nanny
pass the message.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.720
I know who you are.

14:57.670 --> 14:59.870
Speak. What else do you know?

15:01.510 --> 15:02.550
Your Highness,

15:02.670 --> 15:03.960
I truly do not know.

15:04.080 --> 15:06.030
What do you mean, Your Highness?

15:06.750 --> 15:07.750
I was just anxious

15:07.840 --> 15:10.270
to help Your Highness, seeing

15:10.440 --> 15:12.840
Your Highness was unwilling
to write an inscription,

15:12.840 --> 15:14.240
yet didn't dare to reject Mrs. Wu,

15:14.240 --> 15:15.870
and wanted to help share
Your Highness's burden.

15:15.870 --> 15:17.200
If I did anything

15:17.200 --> 15:19.030
to offend Your Highness
and the Noble Consort,

15:19.030 --> 15:20.960
I truly deserve a thousand deaths.

15:24.390 --> 15:25.480
Mr. Tian!

15:26.630 --> 15:28.200
Eldest Young Master Tian!

15:31.200 --> 15:32.150
I, Qi...

15:35.270 --> 15:36.270
say my greetings.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.440
Greetings to you.

15:37.550 --> 15:39.870
Master Qi, why are you here?

15:40.710 --> 15:44.010
I came to Nanjing
on the order of Marshal Qi

15:44.790 --> 15:47.150
and also to visit Garrison Commander Wu.

15:47.440 --> 15:50.700
Since I happened to run into you,
Eldest Young Master Tian—

15:51.120 --> 15:54.910
running into an old friend
in a foreign land—

15:55.480 --> 15:58.600
I naturally had to come and greet you

15:58.600 --> 16:01.120
and your friends

16:01.390 --> 16:03.600
properly.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.200
I cannot accept

16:07.840 --> 16:08.960
Master Qi's toast.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.870
Sure, sure.

16:13.320 --> 16:16.390
Then I'll offer a toast to your friends.

16:16.780 --> 16:17.910
Come on, everyone.

16:19.550 --> 16:20.210
Apologies.

16:20.630 --> 16:21.550
My apologies.

16:21.760 --> 16:23.800
I'll drink as punishment.

16:24.030 --> 16:24.960
I'll drink...

16:27.030 --> 16:27.720
Qi Jiu!

16:28.790 --> 16:29.550
My apologies.

16:29.550 --> 16:30.350
I'll drink...

16:36.190 --> 16:36.730
My apologies.

16:36.730 --> 16:38.850
Excuse me for a moment, Mr. Wu.

16:46.870 --> 16:48.470
Sorry for the interruption.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.630
The Princess was perfectly fine.

16:56.630 --> 16:57.750
Why is Her Highness suddenly angry?

16:57.750 --> 16:59.080
I heard that Li Ink's owner Li Zhen

16:59.080 --> 17:00.320
pissed the princess off.

17:00.320 --> 17:02.250
Li Zhen will probably be executed.

17:10.160 --> 17:11.510
So you're saying

17:11.550 --> 17:14.480
you were doing this entirely
out of the goodness of your heart?

17:14.480 --> 17:15.680
Your Royal Highness,

17:16.000 --> 17:16.880
I...

17:17.589 --> 17:20.050
would never dare have
any ulterior motives.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.000
Amitabha.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.020
Your Highness,

17:23.240 --> 17:25.300
since this lady has good intentions,

17:25.310 --> 17:26.400
it should result in

17:26.720 --> 17:28.510
a good karmic connection.

17:29.550 --> 17:30.960
The Zen Master is right.

17:35.200 --> 17:36.590
You're a smart person.

17:37.030 --> 17:38.960
You should know what you should say

17:38.960 --> 17:40.350
and what you shouldn't.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.060
Do you understand?

17:43.280 --> 17:44.280
I understand.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.350
You may leave.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.080
Thank you, Princess.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.720
Stop right there.

18:00.720 --> 18:02.030
What are you doing here?

18:02.030 --> 18:03.630
I am Qi Jiu, under Marshal Qi.

18:03.640 --> 18:06.000
I came specially
to present a gift to the Princess.

18:06.000 --> 18:08.240
On the guest list
for today's winter solstice gathering,

18:08.240 --> 18:09.550
is there anyone under Marshal Qi?

18:09.550 --> 18:10.350
Yes.

18:12.830 --> 18:13.960
Let me see what it is.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.760
Here's the deal.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.390
I can take you inside.

18:23.440 --> 18:25.400
But whether Her Highness will see you

18:25.400 --> 18:26.680
depends on your luck.

18:26.830 --> 18:27.830
May I ask, Eunuch,

18:27.960 --> 18:29.590
is the person
the Princess is speaking with right now

18:29.590 --> 18:31.590
Manager Zhen
of the Li Ink Workshop?

18:32.510 --> 18:34.030
Don't ask what you shouldn't.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.290
Stop snooping around.

18:35.680 --> 18:36.340
Go quickly.

18:41.200 --> 18:42.030
Zhen.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.070
Are you alright?

18:44.750 --> 18:45.550
Look how scared you are.

18:45.550 --> 18:46.810
I'm fine. Don't worry.

18:47.480 --> 18:48.550
That scared me.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.960
You're too bold!

18:51.110 --> 18:54.310
How dare you have the nanny
pass a message to the Princess!

18:55.550 --> 18:56.750
I just felt that

18:56.830 --> 18:58.310
at today's banquet,

18:58.790 --> 19:01.520
the Lin family set a trap
and the ladies chimed in—

19:01.680 --> 19:03.720
everyone only cared
about their own selfish goals.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.550
No one cared about
what the Noble Consort and the Princess

19:05.550 --> 19:06.720
actually think.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.350
Since the ink I'm making

19:09.350 --> 19:11.120
is a gift from a daughter to her mother,

19:11.120 --> 19:12.640
I couldn't just watch

19:12.680 --> 19:15.240
the Lin family rip open
the Noble Consort's wounds.

19:15.240 --> 19:17.500
That's not why I am making the ink either.

19:20.440 --> 19:21.550
I understand.

19:22.070 --> 19:24.070
But it's difficult to predict

19:24.240 --> 19:25.830
whether something is favorable or not
to the royals.

19:25.830 --> 19:27.790
What if something happens to you?

19:28.680 --> 19:29.720
You know me.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.880
Growing up, I've always been lucky.

19:30.880 --> 19:32.540
I'm perfectly fine, aren't I?

19:33.400 --> 19:34.200
Let's go.

19:36.160 --> 19:37.240
Seriously.

19:37.790 --> 19:38.590
Hurry up.

19:44.510 --> 19:45.480
Qi Jiu?

19:46.400 --> 19:47.480
Are you all right?

19:50.000 --> 19:51.800
-I'm here to present—
-I'm fine.

19:52.070 --> 19:53.930
To present a gift to the Princess.

19:59.270 --> 20:01.870
No wonder you were asking
all those questions.

20:04.200 --> 20:05.830
Are you still presenting the gift?

20:05.830 --> 20:06.590
Yes.

20:14.310 --> 20:16.440
Zhen, I-I'll wait for you over there.

20:21.350 --> 20:22.070
Come here.

20:26.920 --> 20:27.790
I asked you so many questions

20:27.790 --> 20:28.880
at Luoxia Temple,

20:29.070 --> 20:30.240
but you didn't answer me.

20:30.240 --> 20:32.100
You brushed me off and avoided me.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.510
Yet today,

20:33.510 --> 20:35.070
you are so worried about me.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.110
Qi Jiu,

20:38.000 --> 20:39.660
what are you really thinking?

20:41.550 --> 20:42.400
I...

20:44.440 --> 20:45.270
I...

20:51.480 --> 20:52.960
I don't know what you're talking about.

20:52.960 --> 20:53.880
You do.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.910
You know what I'm talking about.

21:01.310 --> 21:02.400
Before,

21:03.590 --> 21:04.830
you helped me a lot.

21:05.750 --> 21:07.110
I wanted to do my best

21:07.750 --> 21:08.440
to protect you.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.350
Stop giving me

21:09.350 --> 21:11.080
these high-sounding excuses.

21:11.350 --> 21:13.030
This isn't the answer I want.

21:18.310 --> 21:19.160
Then...

21:22.960 --> 21:24.220
There's nothing else.

21:27.750 --> 21:28.550
Fine.

21:29.350 --> 21:31.010
Since you won't say anything,

21:31.030 --> 21:32.070
I will.

21:33.110 --> 21:35.880
That day when you gave me
the umbrella at Luoxia Temple,

21:35.880 --> 21:37.790
I was actually very happy.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.310
Today,

21:40.880 --> 21:42.940
seeing how worried you were about me,

21:43.000 --> 21:44.350
I was also moved.

21:45.550 --> 21:46.680
I can see that

21:47.350 --> 21:49.070
you still care about me.

21:49.070 --> 21:50.510
But I don't understand

21:51.010 --> 21:52.540
why you keep pushing me away

21:52.720 --> 21:54.340
without saying anything.

21:56.070 --> 21:56.680
I...

22:03.750 --> 22:04.510
I'm sorry.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.240
Fine.

22:08.750 --> 22:10.010
Since you won't say it,

22:10.510 --> 22:12.550
I will tell you what's on my mind.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.510
Qi Jiu,

22:16.440 --> 22:17.510
what I want

22:18.070 --> 22:20.030
is not someone who does whatever they want
in the dark

22:20.030 --> 22:21.030
and makes sacrifices alone.

22:21.030 --> 22:23.070
I want someone who can stand upright

22:23.110 --> 22:24.750
and walk side by side with me.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.270
I appreciate

22:27.920 --> 22:29.310
your kindness today.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.160
Although I don't have much power

22:33.160 --> 22:35.270
and status as you do, Master Qi,

22:35.590 --> 22:36.680
in Nanjing,

22:36.960 --> 22:39.070
I am at least the manager of Li Ink.

22:40.550 --> 22:42.030
From now on,

22:43.310 --> 22:45.680
I won't bother you
with my affairs anymore, Master Qi.

22:45.680 --> 22:47.350
Please watch yourself,

22:48.030 --> 22:49.630
and do not pester me anymore.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.790
Farewell.

23:10.510 --> 23:12.000
What? Are you afraid to guess?

23:12.000 --> 23:12.680
Just guess.

23:14.350 --> 23:15.880
It's on Miss Wu's right hand.

23:15.880 --> 23:16.590
Careful.

23:18.110 --> 23:20.720
Wrong again. She guessed wrong again.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.350
Ronghua?

23:24.550 --> 23:25.440
Come on.

23:30.070 --> 23:30.790
How does she look?

23:30.790 --> 23:33.310
-Lovely.
-Quite the handsome lady.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.200
Trying to curry favor

23:36.320 --> 23:38.070
with Princess Shouyang in Nanjing

23:38.070 --> 23:39.400
and steal my thunder?

23:39.480 --> 23:41.790
Do you know whose ground
you're standing on?

23:40.540 --> 23:42.830
[Daughter of Commander Wu]

23:41.960 --> 23:42.790
Exactly.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.750
Do you really think the Xu family

23:44.750 --> 23:46.270
values you that much?

23:46.750 --> 23:47.640
Let me tell you,

23:48.000 --> 23:49.240
my father said

23:49.790 --> 23:51.920
that Sage Qing He, you rely on,

23:52.000 --> 23:53.800
won't stay in favor much longer.

23:55.400 --> 23:57.200
Even your own blood brother

23:57.400 --> 23:59.310
bows his head before my father

23:59.310 --> 24:00.350
and my brother.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.850
You? A noble lady from the Capital?

24:03.110 --> 24:04.240
At the end of the day,

24:04.440 --> 24:07.840
you're nothing but a gutter-born nobody
from servant stock.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.200
Guess.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.440
This is outrageous.

24:12.200 --> 24:13.030
Zhen,

24:13.270 --> 24:14.830
I'll go reason with them.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.030
No, you can't.

24:17.830 --> 24:19.720
Ronghua doesn't want to see me anyway.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.880
If we go now,

24:21.000 --> 24:23.240
she will only feel
more humiliated and sad.

24:23.240 --> 24:24.160
You can't go.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.680
Although Ronghua has Xu Wan

24:29.070 --> 24:30.750
and Sage Qing He to rely on,

24:31.310 --> 24:34.040
she is from a humble background
and weak in power.

24:34.920 --> 24:36.350
Happening to run into this farce today—

24:36.350 --> 24:38.270
it was such a farce.

24:38.680 --> 24:39.790
We can only imagine

24:39.960 --> 24:41.920
how hard she's had it,

24:43.030 --> 24:45.690
trying to survive
among the great and powerful.

24:46.960 --> 24:49.220
Ever since Father and I moved to Huizhou,

24:49.440 --> 24:50.880
I'd almost forgotten

24:51.350 --> 24:53.350
how these so-called noble families

24:53.400 --> 24:55.480
in Nanjing and the capital

24:56.180 --> 24:59.390
fawn on the powerful
and trample those beneath them.

25:02.480 --> 25:03.100
Xianglan,

25:03.440 --> 25:04.590
I want you to help me find out

25:04.590 --> 25:06.030
how Ronghua has been doing recently

25:06.030 --> 25:06.790
and

25:06.990 --> 25:08.520
where she lives in Nanjing.

25:08.990 --> 25:10.920
Okay, leave it to me.

25:14.160 --> 25:14.750
Let's go.

25:18.270 --> 25:20.200
Let's leave through another door.

25:23.720 --> 25:24.590
This way.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.150
Master,

25:32.270 --> 25:33.720
I was wondering
why I couldn't find you when I went back.

25:33.720 --> 25:35.000
Why did you come here?

25:35.030 --> 25:35.920
Did you get it?

25:37.070 --> 25:39.110
I followed Tian Benchang
into the inner room.

25:39.110 --> 25:40.440
While he was changing,

25:40.440 --> 25:41.770
I got this list of gifts.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.010
It turns out the people
he wants to give gifts to

25:48.010 --> 25:49.270
are not just Wu Weishi.

25:49.880 --> 25:52.480
Each of those wastrel sons
is receiving a gift.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.920
These aren't ordinary courtesy gifts.

25:55.340 --> 25:58.070
Each one is worth
hundreds of taels of silver.

26:00.590 --> 26:02.200
This Tian Benchang...

26:02.440 --> 26:04.400
When did he become so rich?

26:05.000 --> 26:06.800
He's really spending a fortune.

26:07.830 --> 26:09.560
We have to keep investigating.

26:09.750 --> 26:12.510
Investigate the families
behind those wastrel sons,

26:12.510 --> 26:14.240
their household connections,

26:14.350 --> 26:16.350
and the official posts they occupy.

26:18.960 --> 26:21.550
The final selection
for the birthday inkstick begins.

26:21.550 --> 26:24.550
The Wei family of Songjiang
presents their inkstick.

26:27.920 --> 26:29.880
Your Highness, Zen Master Fahui,

26:29.920 --> 26:32.270
this inkstick symbolizes marital harmony.

26:32.270 --> 26:34.670
We wish the Noble Consort
a happy birthday.

26:34.750 --> 26:38.810
May the Noble Consort and His Majesty
remain in harmony for 10,000 years.

26:48.240 --> 26:49.270
You may step down.

26:54.650 --> 26:57.580
The Wang family of Xiuning
presents their inkstick.

27:00.920 --> 27:03.680
Your Highness,
Zen Master Fahui,

27:03.830 --> 27:07.720
this inkstick takes ink as its substance
and the Buddha as its form,

27:07.790 --> 27:09.680
dedicated to Your Highness

27:09.680 --> 27:11.920
and the Noble Consort.

27:21.680 --> 27:22.920
Step down quickly.

27:26.890 --> 27:29.950
The Tian family of She County
presents their inkstick.

27:36.400 --> 27:37.510
Your Highness,

27:37.920 --> 27:38.880
Zen Master,

27:39.310 --> 27:42.000
the Tian family of She County
presents a pair of Prajna Inksticks

27:42.000 --> 27:43.730
for Her Highness's enjoyment.

27:50.160 --> 27:52.790
What is this scent in these inksticks?

27:53.310 --> 27:54.920
It seems to be there and yet not,

27:54.920 --> 27:56.650
and yet it lingers everywhere.

27:56.920 --> 27:57.780
Your Highness,

27:58.550 --> 28:00.070
when these inksticks were made,

28:00.070 --> 28:03.680
the rare thousand-year-old red sandalwood
was added to the ink paste.

28:03.680 --> 28:06.830
The scent of red sandalwood is light
but condensed and does not dissipate.

28:06.830 --> 28:08.760
When blended with the scent of ink,

28:08.790 --> 28:11.440
it gives off this scent.

28:09.320 --> 28:12.420
[Prajna]

28:12.860 --> 28:15.920
If Her Highness uses
this ink to copy scriptures,

28:16.200 --> 28:17.800
it will help her calm her mind

28:18.070 --> 28:20.830
and show her dedication.

28:22.440 --> 28:23.400
Good ink.

28:24.110 --> 28:26.110
The workmanship is impeccable,

28:26.680 --> 28:29.030
and the dedication
of Supervisor Qi and Ronghua

28:29.030 --> 28:30.890
has greatly impressed me as well.

28:31.750 --> 28:32.880
Your Highness,

28:33.000 --> 28:35.200
this inkstone is called A Leaf of Bodhi.

28:35.270 --> 28:37.600
Its surface is made
of natural stone skin.

28:37.750 --> 28:39.110
Grinding ink with this inkstone

28:39.110 --> 28:41.110
can better bring out the ink's fragrance,

28:41.110 --> 28:44.640
allowing the user to purify their mind
from the very beginning.

28:44.830 --> 28:45.960
Rise and speak.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.490
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:48.920 --> 28:50.720
Please test the ink, Zen Master.

29:08.510 --> 29:10.370
This scent is simple and elegant.

29:10.960 --> 29:13.290
It doesn't grow stronger
after grinding,

29:13.680 --> 29:15.240
but rather gives off

29:15.680 --> 29:19.480
the lingering aroma of incense burning
year-round in a temple hall.

29:19.960 --> 29:21.220
One can almost imagine

29:21.400 --> 29:24.130
oneself in an ancient temple
of a thousand years.

29:24.200 --> 29:25.830
It truly calms the mind.

29:29.500 --> 29:31.990
This ink and inkstone are a natural pair.

29:32.470 --> 29:34.520
Its greatest virtue is its naturalness.

29:34.520 --> 29:37.920
Supervisor Qi is indeed one
of the Five Outstanding Talents.

29:41.720 --> 29:43.050
It writes beautifully.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.880
Rich, sharp strokes without bleeding.

29:44.880 --> 29:46.350
No matter how I dip the ink,

29:46.830 --> 29:49.590
the depth of color stays remarkably even.

29:59.960 --> 30:02.220
Are there any other inks to be presented?

30:02.790 --> 30:04.000
If not,

30:04.200 --> 30:05.790
then today's selection

30:05.960 --> 30:06.960
should be settled.

30:06.960 --> 30:09.960
The Li family from She County
presents our inksticks.

30:11.110 --> 30:13.070
I almost forgot about you two.

30:13.300 --> 30:14.310
Bring them up.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.680
Your Highness.

30:22.750 --> 30:24.550
Li Ink presents Twelve-Season Inksticks

30:24.550 --> 30:26.680
as the Noble Consort's birthday gift.

30:38.350 --> 30:39.350
The kites?

30:40.880 --> 30:42.640
This shape and form

30:42.720 --> 30:44.000
are quite rare.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.750
Your Highness,

30:45.880 --> 30:48.070
these inksticks are shaped like a kite

30:48.110 --> 30:49.570
to symbolize connection.

30:49.880 --> 30:52.350
Even though the kite is far up in the sky,

30:52.550 --> 30:53.720
there is always someone

30:53.720 --> 30:55.310
holding its string.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.550
No matter how high

30:57.550 --> 30:59.480
or how far the kite flies,

30:59.720 --> 31:01.450
it always has a place to return.

31:02.270 --> 31:03.720
The bond between mother and daughter

31:03.720 --> 31:05.830
is just like this string,

31:06.110 --> 31:08.440
unbreakable and unforgettable.

31:08.920 --> 31:10.350
No matter how far apart,

31:10.640 --> 31:12.240
their hearts are connected.

31:14.160 --> 31:15.350
A fine sentiment—

31:16.200 --> 31:19.590
but sentiment alone
does not make good ink.

31:20.240 --> 31:22.900
The quality of the ink
will be known once tested.

31:23.110 --> 31:24.640
Please test the ink, Your Highness.

31:24.640 --> 31:25.880
Rise and speak.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.240
Please test the ink, Zen Master.

31:30.310 --> 31:31.770
Thank you, Your Highness.

31:51.790 --> 31:54.590
Once it touches paper,
the ink feathers slightly,

31:54.960 --> 31:57.070
producing smooth, rounded lines—

31:57.570 --> 31:59.500
so much so

31:59.520 --> 32:00.920
that the writer's brushwork

32:00.920 --> 32:02.720
scarcely affects the result.

32:02.790 --> 32:04.520
You have a keen eye, Zen Master.

32:04.590 --> 32:05.960
When making these inksticks,

32:05.960 --> 32:07.790
I considered
that Her Highness the Noble Consort

32:07.790 --> 32:09.390
is very skilled at painting.

32:09.590 --> 32:10.750
But normally,

32:10.750 --> 32:12.310
writing and painting

32:12.330 --> 32:14.170
require different inks,

32:14.270 --> 32:15.720
which is quite troublesome.

32:15.720 --> 32:18.450
So, I made some improvements
to these inksticks.

32:18.590 --> 32:20.440
I adjusted the glue content slightly.

32:20.440 --> 32:21.790
It asks little of one's brushwork,

32:21.790 --> 32:23.960
favoring smoothness and ease of use.

32:24.310 --> 32:26.350
One stroke forms a clean line.

32:26.880 --> 32:28.880
Dip and write, no adjustment needed.

32:28.880 --> 32:30.200
Amitabha.

32:31.030 --> 32:33.010
These inksticks favor no level of skill.

32:33.010 --> 32:34.890
From an eighty-year-old woman

32:34.920 --> 32:36.480
to a three-year-old child,

32:36.480 --> 32:38.270
everyone can use it smoothly.

32:38.760 --> 32:40.890
There is true Buddhist wisdom in this.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.200
But

32:43.550 --> 32:46.160
why did you make the inksticks so small?

32:46.440 --> 32:48.550
Would it not be used up within days?

32:49.380 --> 32:50.240
Your Highness,

32:50.510 --> 32:52.200
the purpose of these inksticks

32:52.200 --> 32:53.530
lies precisely in this.

32:54.720 --> 32:56.640
These Twelve-Season Inksticks

32:56.640 --> 32:59.960
correspond to the twelve solar terms,
from Beginning of Spring to Minor Cold.

32:59.960 --> 33:01.350
If used daily,

33:01.350 --> 33:04.110
one inkstick can last for a whole month.

33:04.880 --> 33:07.310
Your Highness can present

33:07.350 --> 33:10.150
the Noble Consort
with a new inkstick every month.

33:10.590 --> 33:13.050
By using each delivery
of inkstick as a bond,

33:13.070 --> 33:16.000
the twelve solar terms
become twelve occasions

33:16.270 --> 33:19.270
of celebration spent
alongside the Noble Consort.

33:20.270 --> 33:22.070
To accompany the Noble Consort

33:22.370 --> 33:24.100
through the changing seasons—

33:24.680 --> 33:27.510
showing that Your Highness's
filial devotion

33:27.720 --> 33:29.780
is not confined to a single birthday,

33:31.640 --> 33:34.880
but lives on day after day,
month after month,

33:35.070 --> 33:37.720
year after year.

33:42.640 --> 33:45.440
Such consideration
for the one who uses the ink...

33:45.640 --> 33:47.920
Such thoughtfulness

33:48.070 --> 33:51.200
speaks of a truly filial heart.

33:53.550 --> 33:55.080
You flatter me, Zen Master.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.330
This birthday inkstick

33:57.720 --> 34:00.590
is a gift from the Princess
to the Noble Consort,

34:01.310 --> 34:03.770
and also a gift from a daughter
to her mother.

34:05.110 --> 34:06.270
When I

34:06.310 --> 34:08.000
designed these inksticks,

34:08.670 --> 34:11.480
I thought only as a daughter—

34:11.710 --> 34:14.110
how best to bring joy
to her mother's heart.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.590
I think

34:16.230 --> 34:17.960
to a mother,

34:18.440 --> 34:20.230
nothing matters

34:21.000 --> 34:22.730
more than true companionship.

34:26.030 --> 34:28.670
Therefore, I humbly offer these inksticks

34:28.840 --> 34:32.070
to Your Highness and the Noble Consort.

34:46.320 --> 34:49.030
Supervisor Qi's inksticks
are graceful and dignified.

34:49.030 --> 34:50.550
I like them very much.

34:52.070 --> 34:53.440
The inksticks of the Li family

34:53.440 --> 34:56.030
can connect me with my mother,

34:56.150 --> 34:57.950
which is very rare and precious.

34:58.440 --> 35:00.000
Both ink-making masters,

35:00.400 --> 35:01.600
you have worked hard.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.940
The Twelve-Season Inksticks

35:06.410 --> 35:08.890
is the gift I most wish to give my mother.

35:10.630 --> 35:11.840
I hereby announce

35:12.800 --> 35:15.860
that the winner
of this birthday inkstick selection is

35:16.480 --> 35:17.810
the Li family of Hui Ink.

35:19.360 --> 35:22.800
And the Li family shall also
be granted the ink contract

35:22.800 --> 35:25.000
for my mansion for the next three years.

35:29.070 --> 35:31.150
Thank you for your favor, Your Highness.

35:31.150 --> 35:33.960
Li Zhen and the entire Li family

35:34.960 --> 35:36.960
thank Your Highness for this honor!

35:41.360 --> 35:42.400
Did you get a proper look

35:42.400 --> 35:44.860
at the Wang family
of Xiuning's ink just now?

35:52.670 --> 35:54.670
Supervisor Qi. Senior Qi.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.550
Your Prajna Inksticks
are truly remarkable.

35:57.550 --> 36:00.400
I am deeply impressed.

36:00.710 --> 36:02.400
Today's victory

36:02.440 --> 36:03.730
was pure luck.

36:03.920 --> 36:05.630
You were gracious enough
to hold back.

36:05.630 --> 36:07.190
You sly little thing.

36:07.480 --> 36:09.540
You even moved the Princess to tears.

36:10.200 --> 36:12.330
No matter how fine my inksticks may be,

36:12.510 --> 36:14.240
they cannot stand out anymore.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.670
You're saying I won hearts

36:16.670 --> 36:18.530
rather than won on the ink itself.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.550
Your ink is very good.

36:23.110 --> 36:24.840
Your thoughtfulness
was even more admirable.

36:24.840 --> 36:27.150
At the highest level,

36:27.360 --> 36:29.960
the craft of ink-making
must transcend mere technique

36:29.960 --> 36:32.090
and speak directly to the human heart.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.970
I have learned a lot.

36:38.030 --> 36:38.960
When you go back,

36:39.320 --> 36:41.710
give your grandfather,
Li the Eighth, a message for me.

36:41.710 --> 36:43.760
Tell him to take good care of his health.

36:43.760 --> 36:44.890
If there is a chance,

36:45.070 --> 36:47.400
I will definitely compete with him again.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.540
Safe travels, Senior.

36:58.590 --> 37:00.880
Supervisor Qi is very arrogant.

37:02.000 --> 37:04.670
He seems arrogant on the surface,

37:05.150 --> 37:06.510
but deep down,

37:06.960 --> 37:08.760
he still stays true to the craft.

37:09.670 --> 37:10.510
Zhen,

37:11.190 --> 37:12.710
how did you come up with the idea

37:12.710 --> 37:14.800
of making inksticks
into the shape of a kite?

37:14.800 --> 37:16.800
When I was at the Commander's Manor,

37:17.030 --> 37:19.550
I overheard the ladies saying

37:19.670 --> 37:22.760
the Noble Consort is exceptionally
skilled at painting kite faces.

37:22.760 --> 37:24.420
Whenever the weather is good,

37:24.510 --> 37:25.670
many kites would fly

37:25.670 --> 37:27.400
from her palace.

37:27.550 --> 37:28.800
I inquired about it

37:29.070 --> 37:32.360
and found out this tradition
began the year

37:32.470 --> 37:35.270
Princess Shouyang
left the Noble Consort's side.

37:39.590 --> 37:42.590
The Noble Consort made kites
to cheer the Princess up?

37:43.920 --> 37:44.670
Exactly.

37:46.070 --> 37:48.590
Whenever she misses her daughter,

37:49.030 --> 37:51.920
she flies the kites high and far,

37:52.360 --> 37:55.440
hoping her daughter
outside the palace walls can see them.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.590
So these kites

37:56.840 --> 37:59.500
represent a mother's longing
for her daughter.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.880
That's why I thought of making inksticks

38:01.880 --> 38:03.210
into the shape of a kite.

38:04.510 --> 38:05.320
Come on, we'd better go.

38:05.320 --> 38:07.000
Xianglan is still waiting
for us at the door.

38:07.000 --> 38:07.840
Right.

38:07.840 --> 38:08.940
Let's hurry up and tell her the good news,

38:08.940 --> 38:09.880
so she doesn't wait too long.

38:09.880 --> 38:10.760
Hurry.

38:18.440 --> 38:19.150
Master.

38:19.480 --> 38:20.960
I finally found you.

38:21.590 --> 38:23.190
Boss, another cup, please.

38:23.920 --> 38:25.070
Miss Li Zhen won.

38:25.510 --> 38:26.190
Really?

38:29.000 --> 38:29.920
That's great.

38:30.280 --> 38:32.190
The Princess is deeply
favored by His Majesty,

38:32.190 --> 38:33.960
as everyone in the court and beyond knows.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.590
Secure the Princess's Mansion's
ink contract,

38:35.590 --> 38:38.510
and she's halfway to securing
the imperial tribute ink contract.

38:38.510 --> 38:39.670
This Li Ink

38:40.440 --> 38:42.440
is about to rise to a whole new level.

38:43.400 --> 38:45.150
I knew that when you heard this news,

38:45.150 --> 38:46.480
you would be very happy.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.230
I heard that tomorrow, Miss Yan

38:49.230 --> 38:51.590
is going to host a celebration
for Miss Li Zhen at Zuixian Restaurant.

38:51.590 --> 38:53.360
How about we also go join the fun

38:53.360 --> 38:54.360
and share the joy?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.210
If you want to go,

38:57.440 --> 38:58.590
go by yourself.

39:00.230 --> 39:01.360
Then I won't go.

39:05.150 --> 39:07.110
Master, did you find anything?

39:10.110 --> 39:11.640
Tian Benchang just went in.

39:12.150 --> 39:13.800
These past few days, he and Wu Weishi

39:13.800 --> 39:15.150
have been hanging out with people
from the Ministry of Revenue

39:15.150 --> 39:16.880
and the Ministry of Personnel.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.320
If I'm not mistaken,

39:20.760 --> 39:23.490
he wants
to buy an official position for himself.

39:24.550 --> 39:27.030
But Tian Benchang is a craftsman

39:27.150 --> 39:29.000
and comes from a merchant family.

39:29.000 --> 39:30.660
How can he become an official?

39:32.320 --> 39:33.510
In our dynasty,

39:33.510 --> 39:35.840
some offices are open even

39:35.880 --> 39:37.480
to craftsmen and merchants.

39:37.550 --> 39:38.810
What kind of official?

39:42.800 --> 39:44.190
The Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

39:44.190 --> 39:46.760
The office overseeing
imperial manufacture within the palace.

39:46.760 --> 39:48.290
All the imperial merchants

39:48.480 --> 39:50.920
must deal with
the Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

39:50.920 --> 39:52.360
That's why it wields such power

39:52.360 --> 39:54.160
and reaps even greater profits.

39:54.900 --> 39:56.580
His ambition knows no bounds.

39:57.070 --> 39:58.200
For fame and profit,

39:58.400 --> 40:00.130
he still wants to climb higher.

40:14.960 --> 40:15.760
I understand.

40:16.110 --> 40:16.920
You may go.

40:17.440 --> 40:19.300
Have a sip of tea before you leave.

40:22.000 --> 40:22.930
I'm off, Master.

40:31.590 --> 40:33.400
Zhen truly lives up to her name.

40:38.510 --> 40:39.280
Good.

40:41.880 --> 40:43.440
Godfather, this Zuixian Restaurant

40:43.440 --> 40:44.960
is indeed the best restaurant in Nanjing.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.400
The food is excellent,

40:46.400 --> 40:48.030
and the wine is even more extraordinary.

40:47.470 --> 40:50.790
[Chen Kai, Imperial Seal-Holding Eunuch]

40:48.110 --> 40:49.190
It's a worthwhile trip.

40:49.190 --> 40:50.590
Truly a worthwhile trip.

40:51.070 --> 40:52.190
Coming out of the capital

40:52.190 --> 40:53.180
on official duty with you,

40:53.180 --> 40:55.580
I truly feel I’m in
for some easy blessings.

40:56.360 --> 40:59.760
In all your years in the Directorate
of Imperial Supplies...

40:59.990 --> 41:01.590
They're here, Young Master.

41:09.190 --> 41:10.280
Come, gentlemen!

41:10.280 --> 41:11.360
Let's drink up!

41:11.360 --> 41:12.290
Come on. Come on.

41:15.360 --> 41:16.320
I originally thought

41:16.320 --> 41:18.320
that by fighting enemies
and achieving merit in the army,

41:18.320 --> 41:19.590
Please eat, Godfather.

41:19.590 --> 41:22.110
we would stand out and rise quickly.

41:22.670 --> 41:23.920
But unexpectedly,

41:23.920 --> 41:25.880
that in today's officialdom,

41:27.150 --> 41:29.920
merit is not as useful as money.

41:30.240 --> 41:31.100
Without money,

41:31.470 --> 41:33.330
we can’t get a foothold anywhere.

41:33.360 --> 41:35.550
Exactly. What can we do?

41:36.150 --> 41:36.880
Boss,

41:37.230 --> 41:38.550
what do you mean by that?

41:38.550 --> 41:40.150
You don't know yet?

41:40.190 --> 41:42.590
Many official positions nowadays

41:42.590 --> 41:45.230
are bought with money.

41:46.630 --> 41:48.510
Men like us

41:48.510 --> 41:49.960
spend a lifetime fighting
and bleeding in the army,

41:49.960 --> 41:50.750
only to claw our way up

41:50.750 --> 41:52.480
to some pitiful little post.

41:52.510 --> 41:53.400
Tell me,

41:53.760 --> 41:55.070
where is the justice in that?

41:55.070 --> 41:55.510
Exactly.

41:55.510 --> 41:56.550
Is there any law?

41:56.550 --> 41:57.960
Come on, drink up.

41:57.960 --> 41:59.320
Alright, come, drink.

42:02.760 --> 42:04.000
Exactly.

42:04.360 --> 42:05.960
Speaking of buying offices,

42:06.400 --> 42:08.320
Young Master Wu Weishi,

42:08.320 --> 42:10.190
son of Commander Wu Ru of Nanjing,

42:10.190 --> 42:11.720
truly has his connections.

42:11.840 --> 42:13.550
With just a thousand taels of silver,

42:13.550 --> 42:15.840
he can buy himself a palace post.

42:15.880 --> 42:17.440
That's a lucrative post.

42:18.110 --> 42:19.800
It's not that easy.

42:19.800 --> 42:20.630
I heard

42:20.630 --> 42:21.840
that it's a position

42:21.840 --> 42:24.110
in the Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

42:24.110 --> 42:26.190
According to Young Master Wu,

42:26.260 --> 42:29.150
the entire Directorate
of Imperial Supplies listens to him.

42:29.150 --> 42:31.920
Even the seal-holding eunuch, Eunuch Chen,

42:31.960 --> 42:34.230
obeys his every word.

42:34.320 --> 42:36.000
Once he speaks,

42:36.190 --> 42:38.110
Eunuch Chen wouldn't
dare contradict him.

42:38.110 --> 42:40.760
If Young Master Wu is so powerful,

42:41.090 --> 42:43.520
the gates of the Commander's Manor

42:43.670 --> 42:45.480
must have been trampled flat.

42:46.360 --> 42:47.630
Preposterous!

42:47.760 --> 42:49.150
Matters of my Directorate
of Imperial Supplies

42:49.150 --> 42:50.670
are not for Wu Weishi

42:50.670 --> 42:52.280
to meddle in!

42:54.360 --> 42:55.030
Godfather!

42:55.480 --> 42:56.190
Come, let's drink.

42:56.190 --> 42:57.880
Drink up! Drink up!

42:58.400 --> 42:59.510
Good wine, good food.

42:59.510 --> 43:00.280
Come on. They're really good.

43:00.280 --> 43:00.670
Okay.

43:00.880 --> 43:02.000
Come, let's celebrate.

43:02.000 --> 43:02.510
Come on.

43:02.880 --> 43:04.030
Come on. Come on.
